{"list":"This War of Mine: The Little Ones","platforms":["PS4"],"trophies":[{"id":0,"n":"Epilogue: This War of Mine: The Little Ones","d":"What's next? What do we do? Where do we go?","t":"platinum","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/EAFCBAD1FE11224D897896E7E632DBAB48AA9132.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":1.1},{"id":1,"n":"Epilogue: War is over","d":"The dogs of war have been raging around for so long. I survived and I hope I am not the only one.","t":"gold","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/748654E0F181D1155C2655A0F989157688ED10FD.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":8.2,"h":true},{"id":2,"n":"Diary: Day 7","d":"We’ve been holed up here for seven days, and we’ve managed to keep everyone alive - so far...","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/2173350E29FC27C9DE4CFB9DCAFDAE1F62544874.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":36.5,"h":true},{"id":3,"n":"Diary: Vexing snow","d":"Vexing snow. Half of the city’s buried so deep we can't get there. My kingdom for a snow plow...","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/A725FFB0933FD055F1F879207A8DE234221C9B28.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":16.3,"h":true},{"id":4,"n":"Diary: Finished ransacking","d":"We've explored every nook and cranny of our abode. Now we must venture outside for more supplies.","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/822C8C7D7B1132235C3FF8C8EA09515826C3DA20.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":37.2,"h":true},{"id":5,"n":"Note: Bless the radio","d":"The radio is useful beyond expectations. We get weather reports, important news and music too.","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/13060823A40AD327601C6E611C5B24C246B97EB9.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":29.9,"h":true},{"id":6,"n":"Note: Distilled gold","d":"We managed to distill some moonshine. Under siege, food and alcohol are always in high demand.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/D5E1EBACD2FF6641581CF6567697F91BD7FCA975.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":16.5,"h":true},{"id":7,"n":"Note: Doubled the watch","d":"It's crucial to secure our place against intruders. Two lookouts can watch out for each other.","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/A5115F1D4B63FA78AC0826C8328287C24C5EE613.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":26.7,"h":true},{"id":8,"n":"Diary: Miraculous recovery","d":"Either modern medicines work miracles, or perhaps some of us have really robust immune systems.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/0BF7CA339FDBDC03AF397C5ED0BB30E1E28C96AD.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":1.8,"h":true},{"id":9,"n":"Diary: Patched up and ready to go","d":"What good fortune. We managed to dress these grave wounds and now they are healing nicely.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/D1A819003B96CCD07AD7B77412EDDF45BA37F4CD.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":4.4,"h":true},{"id":10,"n":"Diary: Back from the brink","d":"With just kind words and deeds, we helped one of us survive the darkest depression.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/B6A26FAF3AB7A341BFE29AE2CF72106FDD66BF9F.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":9.5,"h":true},{"id":11,"n":"Diary: Hostel's open!","d":"We now have enough beds for everyone except the one who has to go out and scavenge.","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/E5BD4E1F37BC2FC46061383E55479589318C486F.PNG","g":"default","e":true,"at":"2017-02-03T22:01:04+00:00","r":45.9,"h":true},{"id":12,"n":"Diary: Shooting for five stars","d":"For the first time since we wound up here all of us ate a hot meal. Let's not get used to it yet.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/215D624EBCDBA3C80F520DA679C9D0AEFB4B3C86.PNG","g":"default","e":true,"at":"2017-02-03T21:16:38+00:00","r":32.9,"h":true},{"id":13,"n":"Diary: First blood","d":"One of us had a brush with violent death. Let’s hope there’ll be no more such encounters.","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/0DEBEE730B4E1C137CDF318E2007B5EC9062D9E9.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":38.3,"h":true},{"id":14,"n":"Note: Creature comforts","d":"Our place is starting to resemble a proper home and it keeps the spirits up.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/30BA97854B776553234C74248A3CD8D815D751FD.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":15.3,"h":true},{"id":15,"n":"Diary: Traces of lives","d":"Every building we visit has a story to tell. What kind of story will we leave behind...?","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/276ABC6DEE7FA310F947737214B2F8A5D9328C2C.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":30.3,"h":true},{"id":16,"n":"Diary: We have wintered","d":"The winter's gone. The freeze is over. We made it through... everyone made it! Amazing.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/BE4E9E462469CE813093E0D19E007B0F8BA3FA25.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":7.3,"h":true},{"id":17,"n":"Epilogue: We made it!","d":"At first we hardly dared to hope we’d make it, yet we're still here. It means something… right?","t":"gold","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/8C22898C98F5BFF7E8F2D989C9DD988CD5D1E77B.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":5.5,"h":true},{"id":18,"n":"Diary: We've been everywhere","d":"We've searched everywhere, and there’s almost nothing useful left. This war can't end soon enough.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/4D5A47628645069FF7F412298FAFFD2B0E1D21CC.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":3.6,"h":true},{"id":19,"n":"Diary: We made a stand","d":"Bandits came in packs like hungry wolves. We beat them back every night. And everyone survived.","t":"gold","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/EA79DCA2833438DC1D9437F451EC3013E2E6D510.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":7.3,"h":true},{"id":20,"n":"Note: A bit of indulgence","d":"We all indulged our addictions. It keeps the spirits up… and forget about health issues for once!","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/C7C612171FB03D7C058B888C8FBC842C199DA979.PNG","g":"default","e":true,"at":"2017-02-03T21:04:49+00:00","r":39.3,"h":true},{"id":21,"n":"Note: The school of life","d":"It’s crucial that kids learn to survive on their own. What if we don’t come back one night?","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR09278_00_002EEA3E8DE2001C133969C6A38931B08C1C21E309/337456736587BEFF79558D063172EF48DD399A4A.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":1.2,"h":true},{"id":22,"n":"Diary: Our future","d":"We made it! Schools will reopen soon. From now on, kids will live a normal 